# Repository structure

**Templates:** `templates/<product>/src/templates/<template>/` (`templates/nextjs`, `templates/angular`) — copied to generated apps; self-contained; `.env.*.example` for env values. Each template package's major version matches its product package's major (minor/patch bumped independently); its `@sitecore-content-sdk/*` devDependencies set scaffolded versions.

**Initializers:** `ScaffoldInitData` exports in `templates/<product>/src/initializers/<template>.ts`, listed in the package's `src/index.ts`.

**CLI:** `packages/create-content-sdk-app` — `registry.ts`, `initialize.ts`; reuse `src/common/` processes.

**Samples:** `yarn scaffold-samples`; inside `samples/` use that app's `AGENTS.md`.

Full layout and package map: [`.agents/docs/AGENTS-repo-and-packages.md`](../../.agents/docs/AGENTS-repo-and-packages.md)
